# Cargo.lock is tracked on purpose: this workspace ships the `qjsc` binary and a cdylib,
# so CI builds with --locked against a pinned dependency set.
target

# What `cargo llvm-cov --html --output-dir coverage` and `cargo xtask test-report` write, the way
# the CI workflows do it. The reports that are published come from the Linux job.
coverage
test-output.txt
test-report.html
